"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIMQNvvCya66a6YyDlxwkxjjJPN3uaFI+QD3OjyC8e1UF rebar-mac-492a5c71 joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com 20261119"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":"claude-code_2-1-311_agent","claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":"05f74084-8156-4489-b43f-fbb9222cdc20","comments":[],"created_at":1795144342376198001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"d4ba7dbc-81a3-4f5b-9e83-117e5fada9ce","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"e816-b30a-6a5c-4ae4"},{"link_uuid":"3133589a-65b8-4306-98a1-605aab99aede","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"8983-a808-7ad5-4d20"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe Windows sweep on main at `13210300d78` (scheduled run 44649102885, job `sweep (windows)` 135999196974, 2026-11-19 16:51 PST) fails `tests/unit/test_identity_ts3_117b.py::test_off_keyring_signature_fails_enforcement`. The test arrived with `9a6ed375112` (starving-sphalerite-skua); the previous dispatch on main, run 44621093373 at `0fec72331c4`, had no failure.\n\nThe child prints `verify-identity: FAIL — 1 enforced in-scope event(s) are not verified`. The CLI writes UTF-8 on every platform: `_use_utf8_stdio` in `src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:321` reconfigures stdout to UTF-8. The test's `_verify_authorship` helper (`tests/unit/test_identity_ts3_117b.py:130-141`) runs the CLI with `text=True` and no `encoding`, so the parent decodes with the locale codec: cp1252 on Windows turns the em dash (UTF-8 `E2 80 94`) into `â€”`, and the assertion `\"FAIL — 1 …\" in combined` fails. The log shows exactly that: the expected literal renders as one byte, the actual text as three.\n\nReproduced on macOS by forcing a non-UTF-8 locale codec: `LC_ALL=en_US.ISO8859-1 PYTHONUTF8=0 PYTHONCOERCECLOCALE=0 .venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/unit/test_identity_ts3_117b.py` fails exactly this test (1 failed, 13 passed); under the default UTF-8 locale all 14 pass.\n\n## Approach\nDecode the CLI child's output as UTF-8 in the test, matching the CLI's documented stdio contract (the same pattern `tests/unit/test_windows_text_encoding.py` checks for product parents). Add `encoding=\"utf-8\"` to every text-mode `subprocess.run` in `tests/unit/test_identity_ts3_117b.py` that starts the rebar CLI (the helpers at `:81`, `:136`, `:337` and the call at `:490`). The `ssh-keygen -lf` call at `:228` prints ASCII and also gets `encoding=\"utf-8\"` so the module has no locale-decoded call left.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/test_identity_ts3_117b.py`\n\n## Testing\nThe forced-locale reproduction above passes after the change (14 passed). The module passes under the normal UTF-8 locale. `make verify` passes. A `sweep (windows)` run on main after merge shows this test passing.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `LC_ALL=en_US.ISO8859-1 PYTHONUTF8=0 PYTHONCOERCECLOCALE=0 .venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/unit/test_identity_ts3_117b.py` reports 0 failures on macOS.\n- [ ] `make verify` passes on the change.\n- [ ] A `sweep (windows)` run on main after the merge does not list `test_off_keyring_signature_fails_enforcement` among its failures (run id recorded in a comment).","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/test_identity_ts3_117b.py","reason":"decode the rebar CLI child output as UTF-8"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[["relates_to","8983-a808-7ad5-4d20"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"0f88b2f2-4c9c-4588-8ef9-e5a0407ce1b4","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["windows","portability"],"ticket_id":"ef47-eca9-66ff-4279","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Windows sweep: test_off_keyring_signature_fails_enforcement decodes the rebar CLI's UTF-8 output with the locale codec","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["191fb4bb-4231-4d50-a32c-345bb7ee730f","d4ba7dbc-81a3-4f5b-9e83-117e5fada9ce","9d58aa2f-a551-4e80-92a4-e9144c8f7eed","3133589a-65b8-4306-98a1-605aab99aede","cc02a696-9feb-4911-8297-5cad69b07783","0f88b2f2-4c9c-4588-8ef9-e5a0407ce1b4","7d1d0db3-e964-4421-b9b7-2679e7bb11cc"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795146847464731002,"uuid":"da1bd288-9a99-4151-b816-fc219ea5006c"}